{"candidateAnswer":"Property damage and a vehicle incident","evidence":"[D6:1 | 11:50 am on 16 May, 2023] Calvin: Hey Dave! Long time no chat! Lots has gone down since we last caught up.\n[D9:1 | 3:15 pm on 21 June, 2023] Calvin: Hi Dave! Nice to hear from you. Since last chat, some things have happened. I had a lil car accident last Friday, kinda upsetting but no one was hurt. I've been dealing with insurance and repairs - taking up a lot of time and energy. Look at this photo!","itemId":"urn:uuid:02050419-5c9a-5c02-b923-f9d1fb4cd1a7","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:eb50965a12c4182d55610f238cac2a370e7111d0d7e89eefc397363c1e74549a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What mishaps has Calvin run into?","referenceAnswer":"flooding of his mansion, car accident","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"eb50965a12c4182d55610f238cac2a370e7111d0d7e89eefc397363c1e74549a"}}]}